<!-- SECTION 7: IMPACT & BENEFITS -->
<h1>7. Impact, Benefits & UN SDG Alignment</h1>

<h2>7.1 Societal Impact & Human Rights Protection</h2>
<p>
By intercepting biased algorithmic decisions in real time, FairSight prevents vulnerable populations from being unlawfully denied employment opportunities, bank loans, healthcare treatments, and insurance coverage. It operationalizes "Responsible AI" from abstract corporate pledges into mathematical runtime enforcement.
</p>

<h2>7.2 Corporate Risk Mitigation</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Statutory Fine Immunity:</strong> Protects organizations from crippling penalties of up to &euro;35M under the EU AI Act.</li>
  <li><strong>Brand & Reputational Protection:</strong> Eliminates the risk of public discrimination scandals and investigative algorithmic exposure.</li>
  <li><strong>Operational Efficiency:</strong> Reduces internal compliance audit cycles from months of custom data science scripting to instantaneous automated reports.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7.3 Alignment with United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>🎯 SDG 10 (Reduced Inequalities):</strong> Direct target 10.3 — Eliminates discriminatory algorithms and promotes equal opportunity regardless of race, gender, age, or background.</li>
  <li><strong>🎯 SDG 8 (Decent Work and Economic Growth):</strong> Ensures AI hiring and recruitment algorithms provide equitable access to employment for all qualified individuals.</li>
  <li><strong>🎯 SDG 16 (Peace, Justice, and Strong Institutions):</strong> Builds accountable, transparent, and legally defensible automated institutions.</li>
</ul>

